1	/**
2	 * Mercury Bridge — Searcher (Layer 2: Hybrid Retrieval)
3	 * ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
4	 * Query-time retrieval with:
5	 *   1. Cosine similarity (semantic — existing)
6	 *   2. BM25 keyword scoring (lexical — new)
7	 *   3. Reciprocal Rank Fusion merge (RRF — new)
8	 *   4. Content-type-aware boost multipliers (new)
9	 *
10	 * Retrieval behavior is owned by mercury.config.json.
11	 *
12	 * Rewritten 2026-04-08 for Layer 2 hybrid retrieval.
13	 */
14	
